                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt" lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020061816155379.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></o:p></SPAN></B></P><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt" lang=EN-US>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>6</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>15</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">日下午，我校班主任名师工作室启动仪式暨首期德育论坛在行政楼三楼会议室一成功举行。党委书记、校长王琛，党委副书记、纪委书记孙洪亮出席活动。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>8</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">位新聘班主任工作坊导师和</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>34</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">位新老班主任工作室成员参加了活动，活动由德育处主任杨佩琼主持。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt" lang=EN-US><o:p> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020061816160492.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></o:p></SPAN></P><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">在启动仪式上，王琛代表学校为</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>8</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">位班主任导师颁发聘书。本届班主任工作室导师团队，分别由</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>3</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">位年段长和</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>5</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">位荣获市级先进班级荣誉的优秀班主任组成。王琛强调，学校高度重视学生德育工作和班主任队伍建设，希望在德育处和工作室全体导师们的智慧引领下，广大班主任队伍提升思想境界，锤炼工作本领，与时俱进，把新时代“立德树人”德育目标与学校育人追求自觉践行于每位班主任的每一届、每一班的学生培育引领中去。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt" lang=EN-US><o:p> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020061816161276.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></o:p></SPAN></P><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>     </FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">在随后的德育论坛上，工作室导师代表陈雪萍老师发言指出，班主任工作需要有神圣的使命感、纯粹的初心、强烈的责任感。她祝愿工作室里年轻班主任，尤其是首次带班的新班主任们出色地做好首任、带好首届。“要成为一名好班主任，就要永远在路上，进行无尽的修炼”，她如是说。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=left></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt" lang=EN-US><o:p> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020061816163041.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA">年轻班主任代表王维老师在发言中交流汇报了自己的带班心得体会。她表示，作为新手班主任，向老班主任们虚心求教，从提升班级管理经验入手，积极沟通家长，悉心关怀学生，在学校德育团队的悉心指导帮扶下，一定以优异的班级管理业绩快速完成角色转换和责任担当。</SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA"></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt" lang=EN-US><o:p> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020061816163951.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></P></o:p></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>     </FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">年轻任课教师代表茹奕蓓老师在发言中谈了自己对班主任工作的认识。她表示，从事班主任工作是年轻教师得到快速成长的重要方式，向优秀班主任汲取宝贵的经验是年轻教师在班主任工作中开好头的不二法宝。她表态说，作为一名年轻教师，一定会加强自我修炼，实现自我成长，在班主任工作中竭尽全力发挥自己的光和热，真正做一个有厚度、有宽度、有温度的人民教师。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=left></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt" lang=EN-US><o:p> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020061816165539.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></o:p></SPAN></P><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">工作室顾问孙洪亮做了点评讲话。他提醒工作室的全体老师要抓住教育科研的前沿成果，学习了解最新的上级文件精神、育人方针，以期用于日常的教育实践；结合班级教室雨伞架摆放这一现象，他强调了班主任工作中抓细节、抓常规的重要性。他还结合自身学习实践的工作案例，鼓励老师们多学习、多观察、多思考、多记录，提高学习力，努力成长为省市各级名优班主任。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt" lang=EN-US><o:p> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020061816170253.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></o:p></SPAN></P><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
